Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.54,0:00:03.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is the target I must execute:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.71,0:00:06.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The otherworlder, Akari Tokitou.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.33,0:00:08.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Even if she is killed,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.38,0:00:13.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,she possesses the Pure Concept of Time\Nthat lets her rewind time to before her death.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.38,0:00:16.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,According to Archbishop Orwell,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.29,0:00:21.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,there's a ceremonial hall that can eliminate even\Nan anomaly like Akari in the ancient capital of Garm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.75,0:00:25.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thus, I lied to Akari so that we\Ncould set off together for Garm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.38,0:00:29.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and enjoy the trip, Akari.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.25,0:00:31.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Because when this journey ends, the thing that awaits...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.29,0:00:34.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,...is the end of your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.46,0:02:29.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What a foolish thing my father has done.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.50,0:02:32.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,To think he summoned otherworlders in thirst for power...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.00,0:02:41.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're Princess Ashuna?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.50,0:02:42.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.75,0:02:47.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I am the youngest daughter of King Grisarika,\NAshuna Grisarika.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.63,0:02:49.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.92,0:02:52.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Who might you lot be?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.08,0:02:55.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Listen up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.13,0:02:56.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You'd better stay quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.63,0:02:58.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You'll get what's coming to you if you resist!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.50,0:03:01.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Menou, what's the deal with those people?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.50,0:03:03.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Some typical dissatisfied members of society.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.67,0:03:06.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I guess you could call them terrorists.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.29,0:03:08.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Does this kind of thing happen a lot?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.17,0:03:09.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.88,0:03:11.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Honestly, talk about bad luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.08,0:03:13.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't you move!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.54,0:03:16.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They have guns in this world, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.00,0:03:17.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Those are etheric guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.46,0:03:19.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Though they're actually illegal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.58,0:03:20.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.96,0:03:23.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What are you two blabbering on about-
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.25,0:03:26.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Crap, a priestess.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.13,0:03:28.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Good day, Mr. Terrorist.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.17,0:03:31.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm simply a clergywoman who serves the helpless.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.00,0:03:31.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is there a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.83,0:03:32.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.17,0:03:35.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You priestesses can be dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.29,0:03:37.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You can start by putting your scripture on the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.29,0:03:39.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And after that...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.67,0:03:41.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Take all your clothes off.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.25,0:03:44.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Who knows what weapons you might be hiding?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.67,0:03:50.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, I am hiding a dagger,\Nso it's not totally unreasonable, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.75,0:03:51.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Get on with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.88,0:03:54.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Pipe down, will you? I heard you just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.54,0:03:56.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll pretend to undress to get his guard down, and then...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.79,0:03:58.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,W-wait just a second!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.58,0:04:00.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't do anything awful to Menou!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.71,0:04:03.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll undress in her place, okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.50,0:04:09.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,D-don't worry. I won't let him abuse you, Menou!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.88,0:04:14.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Akari.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.33,0:04:16.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're not making any sense.\NCould you not talk for a moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.58,0:04:19.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Nah, I don't really mind whichever.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.50,0:04:22.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Lay off. She's just an ordinary girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.29,0:04:25.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What you want is to disarm me, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.46,0:04:28.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,For starters, here's my scripture.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.17,0:04:29.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There, here you GO!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.08,0:04:32.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,W-why you...!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.96,0:04:36.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Menou, you're amaz-
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.00,0:04:36.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Shh!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.17,0:04:38.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Please keep quiet, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.83,0:04:41.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There might be more of them in the other carriages.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.13,0:04:45.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That should do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.33,0:04:47.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Listen Akari...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.92,0:04:50.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're a fool if you think you could protect me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.71,0:04:53.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't do anything dangerous, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.33,0:04:54.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,S-sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.88,0:04:56.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.83,0:04:57.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.17,0:04:59.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thanks anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.33,0:05:02.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It made me happy that you were so brave, Akari.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.21,0:05:07.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well then, I'm going to go take out the others,\Nso be a good girl and wait here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.33,0:05:09.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Menou!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.46,0:05:11.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Please be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.83,0:05:14.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't want to be left behind anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.21,0:05:17.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll be fine. See you soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.33,0:05:22.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"Anymore"?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.88,0:05:38.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What an unlucky gang of idiots.\N{\rSubtitle-2}You just had to choose this train to attack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.75,0:05:42.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now, tell me what you want\Nand how many of you there are.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.88,0:05:43.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No way...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.42,0:05:47.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Not to a little brat like you...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.96,0:05:51.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see how it is. If you're not going to talk...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.58,0:05:54.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm going to start sawing at your throat with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.88,0:05:59.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's see if you start talking,\Nor if I'll saw off that head of yours first.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.67,0:06:02.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Which will it be, I wonder?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.00,0:06:05.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.92,0:06:09.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So they're after the Princess Ashuna Grisarika.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.21,0:06:09.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.42,0:06:16.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They intended to take her hostage and demand\Nthe release of their captured terrorist leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.21,0:06:17.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How idiotic.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.92,0:06:19.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How many of them are there?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.42,0:06:21.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thirteen in all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.17,0:06:25.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Five went to the first class carriage where the princess is,\Nand two went to the engine room.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.00,0:06:29.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,For starters, I'll go secure the engine room.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.88,0:06:31.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes, please do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.92,0:06:33.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Miss!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.63,0:06:36.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thank you for getting rid of the bad guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.42,0:06:39.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're very welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.58,0:06:49.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.92,0:06:52.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What an adorable but unexpected guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.33,0:06:54.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Good day to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.21,0:06:58.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm a princess of the kingdom\Nand a knight in my own right-
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.29,0:07:01.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Your Highness, the Princess Knight Ashuna Grisarika.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.83,0:07:03.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Your fame precedes you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.04,0:07:04.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.13,0:07:06.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And who might you be?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.29,0:07:08.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A priestess by the name of Momo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.46,0:07:10.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm a white robe, as you can see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.50,0:07:12.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,An inexperienced novice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.54,0:07:17.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I like the alterations you've done to your priestess robe.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.42,0:07:21.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The human body is beautiful as it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.29,0:07:25.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Clothing is meant to show off the beauty\Nof the bodyline instead of concealing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.88,0:07:27.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's very kind of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.71,0:07:30.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But how fortuitous that you came at this moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.58,0:07:34.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's something I wish to ask you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.38,0:07:40.46,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,What is it you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.08,0:07:42.38,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,Oh, not much.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.71,0:07:46.54,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,It's just that my father is on trial for heresy at the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.54,0:07:49.79,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,I have something of a bone to pick with the Faust.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.21,0:07:53.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is that Momo... and Princess Ashuna?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.83,0:07:55.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I have heard that is the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.79,0:07:59.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But we have yet to know whether\Nyour father actually committed heresy-
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.13,0:08:04.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh? This is a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.67,0:08:06.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What's... this...?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.42,0:08:10.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You intend to cut a priestess down just\Nbecause you have beef with the Faust?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.83,0:08:13.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I intended to stop short, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.21,0:08:17.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If I had swung this royal crested sword with full force,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.04,0:08:19.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,you know a mere fret saw blade\Nwould never have stopped it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.08,0:08:22.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're awfully self-confident.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.46,0:08:25.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then what's the big idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.63,0:08:26.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are they arguing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.08,0:08:29.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, I suppose Momo will be fine on her own.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.25,0:08:34.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I guess I'll have to go to the engine room instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.46,0:08:40.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The otherworlders who my father supposedly\Nsummoned are nowhere to be seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.38,0:08:43.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Perhaps they have been eliminated already...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.04,0:08:47.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,...at the hands of those infamous\NExecutioners of the Faust.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.42,0:08:50.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"Executioners"? We have nothing of the sort.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.13,0:08:53.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Seeing you has made me wonder...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.58,0:08:57.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If the executioner finished her job\Nand left the royal capital,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.38,0:09:00.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,perhaps she would be riding this very train.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.75,0:09:03.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I daresay your imagination has gotten the better of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.96,0:09:05.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Has it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.08,0:09:08.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I have never once doubted the intuition\Nthat the heavens bestow upon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.25,0:09:24.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The Faust truly are skilled.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.13,0:09:28.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Your quick decision to protect your head was brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.71,0:09:30.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.63,0:09:33.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can't have you searing my ribbons now, can I?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.58,0:09:36.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A girl's sense of style is all-important, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.92,0:09:40.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You think so, too? I enjoy dressing lavishly myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.13,0:09:45.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't want some rich girl likening her causal\Nindulgence for finery with my sense of fashion.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.92,0:09:49.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I like all things strong and beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.42,0:09:53.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Obviously, your strength is worthy\Nof my attention too, Momo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.83,0:09:56.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ugh, no thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.75,0:10:05.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You've decided to indulge me, after all?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.25,0:10:10.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Would you like to see how long that arcane\N{\rSubtitle-2}royal trinket of yours can manage against this?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.04,0:10:13.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's good to see you're both all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.75,0:10:16.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sorry we had you concerned, Priestess!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.42,0:10:19.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,As you can see we're all fine here,\Nincluding the etheric engine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.63,0:10:22.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Our Princess Knight knocked 'em out in one blow!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.71,0:10:23.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You know her?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.58,0:10:26.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Princess Ashuna,\Nfamous for going 'round righting wrongs!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.79,0:10:30.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why yes, I know of her. It's unfortunate I just missed-
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.25,0:10:33.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You there, you're only pretending you're knocked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.42,0:10:35.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What do you have implanted in your bodies?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.63,0:10:39.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Busted, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.96,0:10:41.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But you're too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.75,0:10:44.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If we don't make it to Garm we're\Ngonna be hanged, anyway!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.96,0:10:50.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Everyone on this train is going down with us!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.58,0:10:52.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It can't be...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.71,0:10:54.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is that a primary red gem?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.25,0:10:59.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We were told to swallow them, just in case!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.58,0:11:19.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Get out of here before you get sucked in!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.42,0:11:21.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,B-but if we leave our stations...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.42,0:11:23.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll figure it out! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.33,0:11:27.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We'll leave it to you, Priestess!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.75,0:12:26.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It may not have technique but it's got brute force.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.58,0:12:29.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,At least it didn't manifest as an angel or a dragon,\NI suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.13,0:12:33.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If I can just buy some time to wear it down...!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.38,0:12:36.54,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Jeez, is Momo still fighting?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.25,0:12:43.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Momo?\NYou've done nothing but evade so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.29,0:12:49.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Could you please stop calling me by my name?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.75,0:12:52.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Okay, widdle princess?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.96,0:12:57.38,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Now that was interesting!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.54,0:12:59.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't want to hear it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.79,0:13:08.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Seemingly haphazard but actually\Nthoroughly calculated...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.25,0:13:11.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You used magecraft to make it\Ncome flying back, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.25,0:13:13.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But before it does...!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.46,0:13:18.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are you sure about this, Momo?\NI'll force this blade right through.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.88,0:13:21.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'd like to see you try.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.92,0:13:24.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Did her saw blade do this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.79,0:13:34.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Serves you rig-
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.46,0:13:37.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You crappy little princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.33,0:13:46.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Momo...?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.42,0:13:50.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ooh, ouch...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.88,0:13:53.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Even with etheric enhancement, that was pretty rough...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.21,0:13:57.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If only you had died.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.17,0:14:01.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,With all my training,\Na trifle like this isn't enough to do me in.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.83,0:14:02.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Same goes for you, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.83,0:14:14.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The control valve!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.83,0:14:20.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You stupid doll!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.63,0:14:25.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's out of control. That's not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.71,0:14:26.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,At this rate...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.21,0:14:31.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This train will run off the rails,\Nor crash into another train at a station...!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.50,0:14:34.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't have the time to be dealing with this thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.96,0:14:50.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What on earth?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.88,0:14:52.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.63,0:14:54.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That was... disturbing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.58,0:14:59.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Just now, something bizarre just happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.42,0:15:01.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's all I can tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.42,0:15:04.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But this... feels familiar somehow...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.54,0:15:05.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Menou!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.25,0:15:07.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Akari!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.00,0:15:22.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,T-thanks. You're so strong, Menou!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.71,0:15:24.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But what's the deal with that red person?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.46,0:15:26.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,More importantly...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.25,0:15:28.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why did you come? Answer me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.67,0:15:33.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,W-well, because the men tied\Nup suddenly got all mangled
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.04,0:15:35.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and the red lights went\Ntowards the front of the train...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.96,0:15:38.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So why would you go after them?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.75,0:15:41.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I told you to be a good girl and stay where you were,\Nremember?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.88,0:15:46.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I was a good girl just worried about you, Menou!\NYou should be proud of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.63,0:15:48.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why would I be proud?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.79,0:15:52.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If Akari were to get taken in by that thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.58,0:15:55.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll have worse to worry about than\Nthe train not being able to stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.29,0:15:59.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is such a hassle!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.04,0:16:03.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I didn't really want to do this...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.79,0:16:13.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm going to channel my ether into it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.04,0:16:29.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Of course. It won't let me in that easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.63,0:16:30.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But...!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.33,0:16:43.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There! Now perish!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.58,0:17:02.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wow! Amazing, Menou!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.33,0:17:04.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you hadn't come,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.96,0:17:07.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I could have taken it down\Nwithout using this much ether...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.50,0:17:10.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Could it be I was in the way or somethi-?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.88,0:17:12.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Totally in the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.67,0:17:13.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,S-sowwy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.38,0:17:18.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's still out of control...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.71,0:17:20.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I have to do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.88,0:17:31.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I could use magecraft to stop the train,\Nbut I've used too much ether.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.50,0:17:35.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I just don't have enough energy left\Nto conjure on a scale that big...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.63,0:17:44.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Akari...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.50,0:17:45.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hmm? What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.58,0:17:51.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,M-Menou, don't stare at me so\Nintently or you'll make me blush!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.75,0:17:54.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I know this shouldn't really be allowed...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.83,0:17:59.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Akari, will you trust me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.71,0:18:01.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.71,0:18:04.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I always trust you, Menou!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.79,0:18:07.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then listen to what I'm about to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.17,0:18:13.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,M-M-M-M-Menou?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.25,0:18:16.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why are we here?! It's freaking me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.04,0:18:17.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Calm down, Akari.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.58,0:18:20.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can't! It doesn't help that you're looking all stern!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.08,0:18:23.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is this better?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.75,0:18:28.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You definitely look cuter when you smile, Menou.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.75,0:18:31.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Your smile's so dippy, it's as if nothing bad's happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.13,0:18:33.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You mean that as a compliment, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.79,0:18:34.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.21,0:18:41.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Akari, I don't have nearly enough ether to\Ncast the magecraft needed to stop this train.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.33,0:18:44.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So I want to borrow some of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.04,0:18:45.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,O-okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.79,0:18:47.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This will hurt a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.38,0:18:52.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A person's body always reacts violently when\Nconnecting one's ether to someone else's.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.21,0:18:53.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.25,0:18:57.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, I don't like pain... but will you be okay, Menou?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.83,0:18:58.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.88,0:19:02.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You see, I lost most of who I was a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.25,0:19:08.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's why I can connect my ether\Nto others without any pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.13,0:19:10.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.42,0:19:12.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then I'll be okay, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.29,0:19:14.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm fine leaving everything up to you, Menou.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.21,0:19:16.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.71,0:19:21.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.00,0:19:21.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.46,0:19:29.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,First, I'm going to embed my magecraft\Ninto the earthen vein.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.17,0:19:37.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then, I conjure a gate to draw the train to it,\Nand add more power!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.75,0:19:39.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Here we go, Akari!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.71,0:19:54.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Incredible...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.83,0:19:57.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So this is the sheer amount of\Nether otherworlders have.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.79,0:20:01.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This tickles...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.42,0:20:04.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And her body's isn't reacting that violently at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.83,0:20:07.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But there's no time to be surprised. Not right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.00,0:20:20.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Menou...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.29,0:20:21.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Menou...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.79,0:20:22.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.50,0:20:46.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Menou!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.58,0:20:49.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You did it. Wow, Menou. You're amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.92,0:20:52.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.71,0:20:57.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Because priestesses are supposed\Nto be pure, just, and strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.75,0:21:11.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The heavens must truly smile down upon me,\Nto have allowed this encounter with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.67,0:21:13.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now, what will your next move be?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.04,0:21:18.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've gotten involved with such a nuisance...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.71,0:21:23.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We're currently preparing a substitute train.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.42,0:21:25.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Please hold on for just a while longer!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.92,0:21:27.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Miss!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.04,0:21:29.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Millie! It's so great that you're safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.13,0:21:31.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah! You too!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.54,0:21:35.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What if I had failed to stop the train?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.25,0:21:43.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Maybe that actually happened once.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.50,0:21:47.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Maybe I died, along with all the other passengers...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.42,0:21:49.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And then maybe Akari...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.33,0:21:53.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Turned back time?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.08,0:21:59.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Akari.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.63,0:22:04.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Just what kind of power does your\NPure Concept have concealed within?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.50,0:23:39.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Next Episode: The Ancient Capital Garm.
